 "name_en": "Transfer of Bill of Materials for SAP Global Trade Services (24H)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Transfer of Bill of Materials for SAP Global Trade Services (24H)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiof49602dff823403bae6f60c95aab1919\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof49602dff823403bae6f60c95aab1919__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Customers can integrate SAP Global Trade Services 11.0 on-premise with <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> to use existing rules in SAP Global Trade Services.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item enables the communication scenario and the appropriate RFC calls for synchronizing the Bill of Material (BOM). Successful synchronization of BOMs requires that the relevant material masters already exist in the SAP Global Trade Services system.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof49602dff823403bae6f60c95aab1919__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Schedule transfer of bill of materials</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof49602dff823403bae6f60c95aab1919__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Leverage an existing investment in SAP Global Trade Services 11.0 for business being managed in <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span></li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use the existing global trade services infrastructure for a best-of-breed deployment of an international trade solution with minimal new configuration</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>SAP Global Trade Services 的物料清单传输 (24H)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiof49602dff823403bae6f60c95aab1919\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof49602dff823403bae6f60c95aab1919__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">客户可以集成 SAP Global Trade Services 11.0 企业预置与 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span>，以使用 SAP Global Trade Services 中的现有规则。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目启用通信场景和相应的 RFC 调用以同步物料清单 (BOM)。成功同步物料清单要求相关物料主数据已存在于 SAP Global Trade Services 系统中。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof49602dff823403bae6f60c95aab1919__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">计划物料清单传输</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof49602dff823403bae6f60c95aab1919__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">将 SAP Global Trade Services 11.0 中的现有投资应用于 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 中管理的业务</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用现有全球贸易服务基础设施，以最少的新配置以最佳方式部署国际贸易解决方案</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
